      {
        "question": "What is the best season for each trek?",
        "answer": "Autumn (October to November) is best for both. Spring (March to April) is outstanding for Poon Hill's rhododendron blooms. Winter is comfortable on Poon Hill but cold and snowy on Mardi Himal's upper ridge."
      }
