    "desc": "The definitive 2026 guide to Manaslu Circuit Trek food and accommodation: teahouse standards, twin rooms, high camp at Dharamsala, menus, Dal Bhat, vegetarian rules, charging, Wi-Fi, and daily budgets.",
    "lead": "Trekking the Manaslu Circuit no longer requires full tented expeditions and pack mules. Today, the trail is a fully established teahouse route with warm family-run lodges, roaring dining hall hearths, and hearty Himalayan cuisine. Curated by our senior mountain guides at Igloo Himalaya Treks, here is the complete insider guide to daily food, lodging, and living realities on the circuit.",
    "readingTime": "24 min read",
