    "lead": "From the soaring 8,000-meter amphitheaters of Everest and Annapurna to the tranquil subtropical jungles of Chitwan and the ancient medieval courtyards of Kathmandu, Nepal packs more geographic and cultural diversity into its borders than almost any nation on Earth. Curated by our veteran expedition directors at Igloo Himalaya Treks, here is the definitive insider guide to the top 10 destinations in Nepal for 2026/2027.",
    "readingTime": "22 min read",
